🌟 Iman bil Qadr (Taqdeer par Imaan)

💫 Taqdeer ka Matlab

Allah sab kuch jaanta hai 🌙
Allah hi ne hamari taqdeer likhi hai — har acha aur bura dono Allah ki taraf se hai.
Insaan apne nek amaal aur dua se apni haalat badal sakta hai, lekin sab Allah ke ilm ke andar hai.

⚖️ Acha aur Bura – Dono Allah ki taraf se

Agar hum kahen ke sirf achi cheez Allah ki taraf se aur buri cheez hamare bure amaal ki wajah se hai, to yeh baat sahi nahi.
Rasoolullah ﷺ sabse nek insaan the, lekin aap ﷺ ne bhi zindagi mein takleef aur mushkilaat dekhe.
Unhone hamesha Allah par poora tawakkul (bharosa) rakha.

🕊️ Lesson:
Allah hamesha insaan ke liye behtareen chaahta hai.
Kabi kabhi takleef isliye deta hai taake hum uske qareeb aayein.

📖 Qadr aur Qada ka Farq
🔹	Qadr	Qada
📏	Har cheez ka andaza / planning	Faisla aur implementation
🍰 Misaal:	Cake ke ingredients ka andaza lena = Qadr	Ingredients ko mix karke bake karna = Qada
🌈 Taqdeer Par Imaan Kyun Zaroori Hai?

📜 Hadith:
“Ye teen log jannat mein dakhil nahi honge:”
1️⃣ Jo Allah ka nafarman ho
2️⃣ Jo jaadoo par yaqeen rakhta ho
3️⃣ Jo taqdeer par yaqeen nahi rakhta

💬 Nabi ﷺ ne farmaya:
“Allah in logon ke amaal qubool nahi karta agar ye Uhud pahad jitna sona bhi dein.”

🌟 Taqdeer ke Teen Buniyadi Aqeeday
1️⃣ Allah ka Ilm (Knowledge)

📚 Allah har cheez ko jaanta hai — jo ho chuka, ho raha hai, aur jo hoga.
Sab kuch “Lawh-e-Mahfooz” mein likha hua hai.
🕋 Surah Yaseen: 12

“Aur humne har cheez ko ek wazeh kitaab mein likh diya hai.”

2️⃣ Allah ki Mashiyat (Will)

🩵 Allah jo chahta hai, wahi hota hai.
Har achi aur buri cheez Allah ki marzi se hoti hai.
Insaan ke paas apni marzi se amal karne ka ikhtiyar hai, lekin sab kuch Allah ke plan ke mutabiq.

💬 Hadith:
Ek shaks ne Nabi ﷺ se poocha:
“Kya mai apne oont ko bandhe bagair Allah par tawakkul karun?”
Nabi ﷺ ne farmaya:
“Bandho aur tawakkul karo.” 🤲

3️⃣ Allah Har Cheez ka Khaaliq (Creator)

🌍 Har cheez Allah ne paida ki hai — humari shakl, rizq, sehat, zindagi aur maut sab uske ilm mein hai.

🌸 Qadr Mein Kya Kya Shamil Hai?

1️⃣ Shakl o Surat:
Allah ne Aadam (AS) ko mitti se paida kiya – har insan alag hai.
2️⃣ Rizq:
Hadith: “Kisi ka rizq kam ya zyada hone par mayoos na ho, jab tak uska likha hua rizq us tak na pohonche, maut nahi aayegi.”
3️⃣ Sehat:
Beemari aur sehat dono taqdeer se hain, lekin ehtiyaat lena hamari zimmedari hai.
4️⃣ Zindagi:
Isa (AS) ko bagair baap ke paida kiya – Allah ke hukum se.
5️⃣ Maut:
Maut kab, kahan, kaise aayegi – sab likha hua hai.

🌷 Hadith:

“Momin ke liye har haal mein khair hai.
Jab kuch accha hota hai to wo shukr karta hai – aur yeh uske liye behtareen hai.
Jab kuch bura hota hai to wo sabr karta hai – aur yeh bhi uske liye behtareen hai.”

🌺 Qadr Par Imaan Ke Fayde

✨ Allah par tawakkul mazboot hota hai
🕊️ Dil ko sukoon milta hai, chaahe nateeja kuch bhi ho
💪 Museebat mein sabr badhta hai
💫 Gunah maaf hote hain

💬 Hadith:

“Momin ko jo bhi takleef pohonchti hai, yahan tak ke ek kaanta bhi chub jaaye,
Allah uske gunah maaf kar deta hai.”

🌿 Khulasah:

Taqdeer par imaan rakhnay se insaan ka dil mazboot, sukoon bhara aur Allah par tawakkul wala ban jata hai 💖
Sab kuch Allah ke ilm aur hikmat ke mutabiq hota hai — aur Allah kabhi zulm nahi karta.

🕌 JazakAllahu Khairan!
